WEBVTT

00:00:29.188 --> 00:00:33.561
most of the students were slumped over,
dozing or looking at their phones.

00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:37.523
I ended my talk with a hopeful request
for any questions.

00:00:37.879 --> 00:00:40.831
And one hand shot up right away.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:45.896
I looked encouraging, he stood up,
and in a loud voice, he said,

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.737
"You're a democrat, aren't you?"

00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:50.419
(Laughter)

00:00:50.443 --> 00:00:52.378
"No," I said, "I'm Canadian."

00:00:52.402 --> 00:00:54.797
(Laughter)

00:00:54.821 --> 00:01:00.247
(Applause)